### Search: GET /search?q=   (active products by name/description/SKU, plus category names)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Simple search (case-insensitive; name matches are listed first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=linen

### Search by SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=drs-001

### With filters: price range, in-stock only, one category
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=dress&min_price=50&max_price=150&in_stock=true&category_id=1

### Pagination (total_products counts all matches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=silk&skip=0&limit=5

### Missing q  -> 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/search

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
